1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:52,465 --> 00:01:53,605
Here.

3
00:02:07,945 --> 00:02:09,885
Boss, look.

4
00:02:10,145 --> 00:02:11,365
We just dug this up.

5
00:02:13,865 --> 00:02:15,601
You heartless bastards!

6
00:02:15,625 --> 00:02:17,521
What are you doing?

7
00:02:17,545 --> 00:02:20,001
What are you doing?

8
00:02:20,025 --> 00:02:22,001
Have you no humanity?

9
00:02:22,025 --> 00:02:24,605
You're utterly inhuman!

10
00:02:25,025 --> 00:02:26,765
Give me back my mother!

11
00:02:33,265 --> 00:02:34,161
Murder!

12
00:02:34,185 --> 00:02:35,401
Murder!

13
00:02:35,425 --> 00:02:38,685
There's no law anymore!

14
00:02:39,585 --> 00:02:41,161
They dug up his family's grave too.

15
00:02:41,185 --> 00:02:42,885
Master Lü.

16
00:02:43,425 --> 00:02:45,685
This is for you.

17
00:02:46,265 --> 00:02:47,681
My mother's remains...

18
00:02:47,705 --> 00:02:50,761
Please have mercy and return them.

19
00:02:50,785 --> 00:02:54,245
Let her rest in peace.

20
00:03:03,905 --> 00:03:05,845
This is only the ransom.

21
00:03:06,105 --> 00:03:07,245
Ransom?

22
00:03:07,825 --> 00:03:10,201
All the land on this hill

23
00:03:10,225 --> 00:03:12,365
belongs to us now.

24
00:03:13,825 --> 00:03:15,201
None of you

25
00:03:15,225 --> 00:03:17,725
may bury your families here

26
00:03:18,905 --> 00:03:20,045
unless

27
00:03:20,465 --> 00:03:22,401
you pay us a yearly corpse-protection fee.

28
00:03:22,425 --> 00:03:24,201
Then I'll have my men

29
00:03:24,225 --> 00:03:25,841
find a good burial place for your mother.

30
00:03:25,865 --> 00:03:27,245
Well?

31
00:03:27,745 --> 00:03:29,561
-Mother!
-How can you do this?

32
00:03:29,585 --> 00:03:31,881
Our ancestors have used this hill

33
00:03:31,905 --> 00:03:33,641
to bury our loved ones for generations.

34
00:03:33,665 --> 00:03:35,441
Since when did it belong to you?

35
00:03:35,465 --> 00:03:37,361
-Exactly.
-That's right.

36
00:03:37,385 --> 00:03:39,361
Since when did it belong to you?

37
00:03:39,385 --> 00:03:41,721
What are you doing? Let me go!

38
00:03:41,745 --> 00:03:44,201
Aren't you afraid of retribution?

39
00:03:44,225 --> 00:03:45,121
Heavens!

40
00:03:45,145 --> 00:03:46,325
Let me go!

41
00:03:50,225 --> 00:03:51,765
Retribution?

42
00:03:52,385 --> 00:03:54,441
The dead can't take revenge.

43
00:03:54,465 --> 00:03:55,761
What do we do?

44
00:03:55,785 --> 00:03:56,681
What do we do?

45
00:03:56,705 --> 00:03:58,161
What else can we do?

46
00:03:58,185 --> 00:03:59,521
Hurry home

47
00:03:59,545 --> 00:04:01,521
and raise the money.

48
00:04:01,545 --> 00:04:03,201
Go...

49
00:04:03,225 --> 00:04:05,525
-Raise the money.
-Shopkeeper Jia.

50
00:04:05,945 --> 00:04:08,481
Didn't he want his father's body back?

51
00:04:08,505 --> 00:04:09,481
Now it's settled.

52
00:04:09,505 --> 00:04:11,321
I reunited the two of them.

53
00:04:11,345 --> 00:04:13,121
Re... reunited?

54
00:04:13,145 --> 00:04:14,641
Reunited...

55
00:04:14,665 --> 00:04:16,761
What about you? Have you decided?

56
00:04:16,785 --> 00:04:19,401
Either take your mother's body

57
00:04:19,425 --> 00:04:20,921
back home, or...

58
00:04:20,945 --> 00:04:22,641
I'll pay...

59
00:04:22,665 --> 00:04:25,125
I'll pay...

60
00:04:26,185 --> 00:04:28,561
I'll pay...

61
00:04:28,585 --> 00:04:30,125
I'll pay.

62
00:04:33,985 --> 00:04:35,561
Hand over the money.

63
00:04:35,585 --> 00:04:37,525
Must my boss repeat himself?

64
00:04:38,865 --> 00:04:40,241
Come here.

65
00:04:40,265 --> 00:04:42,161
-Who told you to come?
-Boss.

66
00:04:42,185 --> 00:04:43,641
The chief banned me
from work for two days.

67
00:04:43,665 --> 00:04:45,165
I'm bored out of my mind.

68
00:04:45,505 --> 00:04:46,641
It's just collecting burial fees.

69
00:04:46,665 --> 00:04:47,805
I can do that too.

70
00:04:49,145 --> 00:04:51,405
Don't you know why you're not allowed?

71
00:04:53,345 --> 00:04:55,885
Don't you realize how badly you messed up?

72
00:04:56,265 --> 00:04:58,721
If the chief didn't have allies at court,

73
00:04:58,745 --> 00:05:00,161
the Tiger Roar Gang would've been exposed.

74
00:05:00,185 --> 00:05:01,601
Boss.

75
00:05:01,625 --> 00:05:03,045
Can't I just follow you?

76
00:05:03,505 --> 00:05:04,721
Get lost.

77
00:05:04,745 --> 00:05:07,205
-Boss!
-Get lost!

78
00:05:19,505 --> 00:05:21,161
Keep digging.

79
00:05:21,185 --> 00:05:22,325
-Yes.
-Yes.

80
00:05:27,385 --> 00:05:29,045
After ten years of hard study,

81
00:05:30,265 --> 00:05:32,885
today I finally stand here as an official

82
00:05:33,065 --> 00:05:34,805
before the Son of Heaven.

83
00:05:38,065 --> 00:05:40,321
Official Meng, that robe
truly shines on you.

84
00:05:40,345 --> 00:05:41,361
But once we enter the hall,

85
00:05:41,385 --> 00:05:43,445
don't let the spectacle
make your knees buckle.

86
00:05:44,425 --> 00:05:46,725
When Young Official Shen
first attended court,

87
00:05:46,945 --> 00:05:48,841
did your knees buckle?

88
00:05:48,865 --> 00:05:50,205
Of course not.

89
00:05:50,905 --> 00:05:52,965
Then tell me, Young Official Shen,

90
00:05:53,305 --> 00:05:55,725
what is His Majesty like in court?

91
00:05:57,345 --> 00:05:59,405
Have you heard the saying,

92
00:06:00,505 --> 00:06:01,961
"Serving the emperor is
like serving a tiger"?

93
00:06:01,985 --> 00:06:03,405
I have.

94
00:06:06,905 --> 00:06:08,761
When His Majesty loses his temper,

95
00:06:08,785 --> 00:06:10,285
his wrath is thunderous.

96
00:06:10,785 --> 00:06:11,801
Last month, a colleague

97
00:06:11,825 --> 00:06:13,481
said one unnecessary word during a report

98
00:06:13,505 --> 00:06:15,641
and was dismissed and investigated.

99
00:06:15,665 --> 00:06:16,761
Another colleague

100
00:06:16,785 --> 00:06:18,521
angered His Majesty

101
00:06:18,545 --> 00:06:19,685
and was directly...

102
00:06:23,945 --> 00:06:25,081
But don't worry.

103
00:06:25,105 --> 00:06:26,241
For Zhili's sake,

104
00:06:26,265 --> 00:06:28,001
I won't stand by.

105
00:06:28,025 --> 00:06:29,161
If anyone makes trouble for you,

106
00:06:29,185 --> 00:06:30,725
I, Shen Zhishu, will...

107
00:06:33,185 --> 00:06:35,041
Official Meng, I wasn't finished.

108
00:06:35,065 --> 00:06:37,725
His Majesty arrives!

109
00:06:47,745 --> 00:06:49,521
Welcome, Your Majesty.

110
00:06:49,545 --> 00:06:52,241
May Your Majesty be blessed.

111
00:06:52,265 --> 00:06:53,925
Rise, my ministers.

112
00:07:07,665 --> 00:07:09,165
Thank you.

113
00:07:11,505 --> 00:07:12,401
Sister.

114
00:07:12,425 --> 00:07:15,365
The autumn wind is cold.
Don't catch a chill.

115
00:07:16,945 --> 00:07:18,801
What has our brilliant Lady Shen

116
00:07:18,825 --> 00:07:19,965
so worried?

117
00:07:20,785 --> 00:07:21,841
As I always say,

118
00:07:21,865 --> 00:07:22,761
there is no problem

119
00:07:22,785 --> 00:07:24,965
that wine can't solve.

120
00:07:36,985 --> 00:07:38,961
You really are troubled.

121
00:07:38,985 --> 00:07:40,845
His Majesty has issued a decree

122
00:07:41,025 --> 00:07:43,081
appointing me Assistant Director
of the Bureau of Intelligence

123
00:07:43,105 --> 00:07:44,681
to help Official Meng

124
00:07:44,705 --> 00:07:46,645
root out corruption and
evil in the capital.

125
00:07:47,665 --> 00:07:50,001
His Majesty intends to put
your talents to good use.

126
00:07:50,025 --> 00:07:51,721
But this appointment came so suddenly

127
00:07:51,745 --> 00:07:53,725
that he did not even hint at it to me.

128
00:07:53,985 --> 00:07:56,365
The Bureau of Intelligence
investigates corrupt officials.

129
00:07:56,545 --> 00:07:58,001
Violence will be unavoidable.

130
00:07:58,025 --> 00:07:59,721
I have always been afraid of blood

131
00:07:59,745 --> 00:08:01,481
and prefer peace and refinement.

132
00:08:01,505 --> 00:08:03,485
I am clearly better suited
to the Hanlin Academy.

133
00:08:04,585 --> 00:08:05,801
Silly sister.

134
00:08:05,825 --> 00:08:07,681
If His Majesty wants to use your talents,

135
00:08:07,705 --> 00:08:09,081
he must have his reasons.

136
00:08:09,105 --> 00:08:11,241
Fighting evil depends on this,

137
00:08:11,265 --> 00:08:13,241
not brute force.

138
00:08:13,265 --> 00:08:14,441
You have been clever since childhood.

139
00:08:14,465 --> 00:08:15,641
What others cannot accomplish

140
00:08:15,665 --> 00:08:16,561
is, for you,

141
00:08:16,585 --> 00:08:17,881
a piece of cake.

142
00:08:17,905 --> 00:08:20,125
Easy for you to say.

143
00:08:21,465 --> 00:08:23,325
The Bureau has only just been established.

144
00:08:23,785 --> 00:08:26,445
Those local thugs are trouble enough,

145
00:08:27,065 --> 00:08:29,401
not to mention the smiling tigers at court

146
00:08:29,425 --> 00:08:31,081
and all the traps they
must be laying in secret.

147
00:08:31,105 --> 00:08:33,281
This time, even you

148
00:08:33,305 --> 00:08:34,641
cannot discern His Majesty's intentions.

149
00:08:34,665 --> 00:08:35,641
How can I not worry?

150
00:08:35,665 --> 00:08:36,921
Brother.

151
00:08:36,945 --> 00:08:37,961
Sister Zhili's concerns

152
00:08:37,985 --> 00:08:39,441
are not unreasonable.

153
00:08:39,465 --> 00:08:42,081
The Hanlin Academy is
prestigious and peaceful,

154
00:08:42,105 --> 00:08:43,361
perfectly suited to her temperament.

155
00:08:43,385 --> 00:08:44,441
However,

156
00:08:44,465 --> 00:08:46,765
this transfer came so suddenly.

157
00:08:47,225 --> 00:08:48,121
Perhaps

158
00:08:48,145 --> 00:08:50,285
we should petition His Majesty tomorrow.

159
00:08:50,905 --> 00:08:52,525
A-Nian is the one who understands me.

160
00:08:54,145 --> 00:08:55,681
His Majesty's move

161
00:08:55,705 --> 00:08:57,321
may be difficult to fathom,

162
00:08:57,345 --> 00:08:59,001
but from what I know of him,

163
00:08:59,025 --> 00:09:01,441
he must have considered it carefully.

164
00:09:01,465 --> 00:09:02,761
After all, whoever he may harm,

165
00:09:02,785 --> 00:09:04,841
-he would never harm our Zhili.
-Brother.

166
00:09:04,865 --> 00:09:06,121
But I think

167
00:09:06,145 --> 00:09:07,721
-His Majesty did this because...
-A-Nian.

168
00:09:07,745 --> 00:09:09,361
Then tell me.

169
00:09:09,385 --> 00:09:11,441
His Majesty has always
treated us like siblings.

170
00:09:11,465 --> 00:09:13,481
He trusts and relies
on us above all others.

171
00:09:13,505 --> 00:09:15,481
Now is the time when he
needs capable people.

172
00:09:15,505 --> 00:09:16,845
Other than Zhili,

173
00:09:17,105 --> 00:09:18,761
who else could serve

174
00:09:18,785 --> 00:09:20,881
as Assistant Director of the Bureau?

175
00:09:20,905 --> 00:09:22,885
Since His Majesty has
arranged it this way,

176
00:09:23,545 --> 00:09:25,005
I will accept the post.

177
00:09:26,065 --> 00:09:27,121
That's more like it.

178
00:09:27,145 --> 00:09:28,521
With you and Official Meng together,

179
00:09:28,545 --> 00:09:30,765
those vermin will tremble at your names.

180
00:09:35,745 --> 00:09:36,885
What?

181
00:09:37,585 --> 00:09:39,721
Am I some terrifying monster?

182
00:09:39,745 --> 00:09:42,085
Even in the bath, you
sit so far away from me.

183
00:09:45,025 --> 00:09:46,481
When we were your princely companions,

184
00:09:46,505 --> 00:09:48,721
Your Majesty was merely
more perceptive than most.

185
00:09:48,745 --> 00:09:51,121
But now you have secured
the Right Chancellor

186
00:09:51,145 --> 00:09:53,361
and turned your blade on the Left.
Your moods are unpredictable.

187
00:09:53,385 --> 00:09:55,325
If we should misspeak or misbehave...

188
00:09:57,865 --> 00:09:59,921
The four of us grew up together.

189
00:09:59,945 --> 00:10:01,845
Have your lapses in speech
and conduct ever been few?

190
00:10:02,385 --> 00:10:03,521
Come.

191
00:10:03,545 --> 00:10:05,561
What treasonous nonsense
do you have for me today?

192
00:10:05,585 --> 00:10:07,161
Let me hear it.

193
00:10:07,185 --> 00:10:08,801
First, Your Majesty must
promise not to get angry.

194
00:10:08,825 --> 00:10:10,721
At least for this hour in the hot spring,

195
00:10:10,745 --> 00:10:12,525
be the man you were as Crown Prince.

196
00:10:13,505 --> 00:10:14,725
Very well.

197
00:10:19,585 --> 00:10:20,841
How dare you?

198
00:10:20,865 --> 00:10:23,081
Shen Zhishu!

199
00:10:23,105 --> 00:10:24,201
I was only testing the waters.

200
00:10:24,225 --> 00:10:26,285
Your Majesty gave your
imperial word not to get angry.

201
00:10:26,825 --> 00:10:28,005
I am not angry.

202
00:10:28,585 --> 00:10:30,125
I merely remembered

203
00:10:30,465 --> 00:10:32,485
how, when I was Crown Prince,

204
00:10:32,665 --> 00:10:35,045
I used to discipline all of you.

205
00:10:35,305 --> 00:10:36,685
Your Majesty!

206
00:10:37,065 --> 00:10:38,481
Spare me, Your Majesty!

207
00:10:38,505 --> 00:10:40,325
A-Nian, why are you just standing there?

208
00:10:44,065 --> 00:10:46,485
I have not relaxed like
this in a long time.

209
00:10:48,145 --> 00:10:49,405
When I was sixteen,

210
00:10:50,185 --> 00:10:51,521
I toured the realm for the emperor

211
00:10:51,545 --> 00:10:53,685
and toured all seven prefectures
and nineteen counties.

212
00:10:54,305 --> 00:10:55,441
Now, even leaving the palace

213
00:10:55,465 --> 00:10:56,761
requires consulting the almanac.

214
00:10:56,785 --> 00:10:58,241
Last time, Your Majesty
pretended to be drunk

215
00:10:58,265 --> 00:10:59,641
and angered the Left Chancellor so badly

216
00:10:59,665 --> 00:11:01,201
that he submitted a
memorial claiming illness.

217
00:11:01,225 --> 00:11:02,925
Why are you troubled now?

218
00:11:03,345 --> 00:11:04,725
He is hardly ill.

219
00:11:05,225 --> 00:11:07,801
Half the officials send their
memorials to his bedside.

220
00:11:07,825 --> 00:11:09,681
He is practically acting as
regent from his residence.

221
00:11:09,705 --> 00:11:11,681
I merely made him lose face.

222
00:11:11,705 --> 00:11:13,641
Is he trying to show me who is in charge?

223
00:11:13,665 --> 00:11:15,561
The memorials now being submitted

224
00:11:15,585 --> 00:11:16,725
either...

225
00:11:16,905 --> 00:11:18,681
demand strict reviews of female officials,

226
00:11:18,705 --> 00:11:21,041
or urge me to appoint an
empress to secure the dynasty.

227
00:11:21,065 --> 00:11:21,961
That stubborn old man

228
00:11:21,985 --> 00:11:24,161
is flaunting his status as
a veteran of three reigns,

229
00:11:24,185 --> 00:11:25,721
waiting for Your Majesty
to invite him back.

230
00:11:25,745 --> 00:11:27,761
The Bureau of Intelligence has
only just been established.

231
00:11:27,785 --> 00:11:29,521
I would rather he rested a few more days

232
00:11:29,545 --> 00:11:31,205
and spared me the trouble.

233
00:11:31,945 --> 00:11:33,601
Yesterday, under the pretext
of viewing paintings,

234
00:11:33,625 --> 00:11:36,205
invited only Meng and Zhili to a banquet.

235
00:11:36,465 --> 00:11:38,325
It seemed he meant to win them over.

236
00:11:38,945 --> 00:11:40,485
I heard from Sister Zhili

237
00:11:40,825 --> 00:11:42,761
that the Right Chancellor is

238
00:11:42,785 --> 00:11:43,681
deeply invested in it

239
00:11:43,705 --> 00:11:45,441
and promised to offer his full support.

240
00:11:45,465 --> 00:11:46,881
The Right Chancellor is clearly

241
00:11:46,905 --> 00:11:48,921
challenging the Left Chancellor.

242
00:11:48,945 --> 00:11:50,401
Official Meng has only just taken office.

243
00:11:50,425 --> 00:11:51,801
She may be in for a difficult time.

244
00:11:51,825 --> 00:11:54,481
If she cannot endure even this much,

245
00:11:54,505 --> 00:11:56,325
how can she lead the
Bureau of Intelligence?

246
00:11:56,665 --> 00:11:57,561
Official Meng? I do not know.

247
00:11:57,585 --> 00:11:59,805
but our Zhili certainly cannot endure it.

248
00:12:00,065 --> 00:12:01,601
Speaking of which,

249
00:12:01,625 --> 00:12:03,081
the Left Chancellor's call for an empress

250
00:12:03,105 --> 00:12:04,561
is not entirely wrong.

251
00:12:04,585 --> 00:12:06,481
Handsome face aside,

252
00:12:06,505 --> 00:12:07,561
with that temper of yours,

253
00:12:07,585 --> 00:12:09,201
always shouting, "How dare
you?" and "Insolence!"

254
00:12:09,225 --> 00:12:10,201
"Withdraw!"

255
00:12:10,225 --> 00:12:11,845
what young lady would dare approach you?

256
00:12:12,465 --> 00:12:13,925
What did you say?

257
00:12:19,345 --> 00:12:21,405
See? I was right.

258
00:12:22,265 --> 00:12:24,001
Zhili and Your Majesty
were childhood sweethearts.

259
00:12:24,025 --> 00:12:26,521
She even used to call you "Brother Ying."

260
00:12:26,545 --> 00:12:27,441
But look at her now.

261
00:12:27,465 --> 00:12:28,761
The way she looks at our teacher

262
00:12:28,785 --> 00:12:31,081
-She looks at our teacher more warmly.
-Nonsense.

263
00:12:31,105 --> 00:12:33,841
Sister Zhili only respects
the Right Chancellor.

264
00:12:33,865 --> 00:12:35,441
The Right Chancellor is nearly fifty.

265
00:12:35,465 --> 00:12:36,481
He also has a family.

266
00:12:36,505 --> 00:12:38,041
He spends all day putting on airs.

267
00:12:38,065 --> 00:12:39,881
-How could Sister Zhili possibly...
-You brat.

268
00:12:39,905 --> 00:12:40,801
You train every day

269
00:12:40,825 --> 00:12:42,561
wrestling with the Divine
Guard made you dull.

270
00:12:42,585 --> 00:12:44,485
What do you know about a woman's heart?

271
00:12:48,265 --> 00:12:50,361
Your Majesty, stop scowling all the time.

272
00:12:50,385 --> 00:12:52,365
Otherwise, even fewer women
will dare approach you.

273
00:12:54,625 --> 00:12:56,361
Most of the time,

274
00:12:56,385 --> 00:12:58,445
I am smiling, am I not?

275
00:12:58,705 --> 00:13:00,241
Your smile hides a blade.

276
00:13:00,265 --> 00:13:02,085
It is more frightening
than no smile at all.

277
00:13:04,625 --> 00:13:05,681
Then tell me,

278
00:13:05,705 --> 00:13:06,721
inside this palace,

279
00:13:06,745 --> 00:13:08,161
is there anyone

280
00:13:08,185 --> 00:13:09,925
who dares behave casually with me?

281
00:13:11,185 --> 00:13:12,325
Who?

282
00:13:15,385 --> 00:13:16,321
Just drink.

283
00:13:16,345 --> 00:13:18,001
Come, let us drink.

284
00:13:18,025 --> 00:13:19,885
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

285
00:13:24,945 --> 00:13:28,045
Did I strike a nerve, Your Majesty?

286
00:13:29,865 --> 00:13:31,841
The hour is over.

287
00:13:31,865 --> 00:13:34,085
Are you sure you wish to continue?

288
00:13:58,785 --> 00:13:59,925
Official Meng.

289
00:14:14,745 --> 00:14:15,721
Here.

290
00:14:15,745 --> 00:14:17,045
Thank you.

291
00:14:21,945 --> 00:14:23,121
Assistant Shen.

292
00:14:23,145 --> 00:14:25,925
Did you empty your entire study at home?

293
00:14:26,185 --> 00:14:28,281
They are merely things I
am accustomed to using.

294
00:14:28,305 --> 00:14:29,361
I originally planned

295
00:14:29,385 --> 00:14:30,641
to bring two maids to clean,

296
00:14:30,665 --> 00:14:33,161
but I feared my brother
and A-Nian would mock me

297
00:14:33,185 --> 00:14:34,765
for turning the Bureau into a boudoir.

298
00:14:35,465 --> 00:14:37,125
I nearly forgot the most important thing.

299
00:14:42,105 --> 00:14:43,081
I grew it myself.

300
00:14:43,105 --> 00:14:44,561
with my own hands.

301
00:14:44,585 --> 00:14:45,881
It is for you, Official Meng.

302
00:14:45,905 --> 00:14:46,841
Place it on your desk.

303
00:14:46,865 --> 00:14:48,645
It is perfect for calming the mind.

304
00:14:52,025 --> 00:14:54,165
It truly has a delightful fragrance.

305
00:14:56,465 --> 00:14:57,961
On our first day in office,

306
00:14:57,985 --> 00:15:00,121
shall we turn this cold, lifeless Bureau

307
00:15:00,145 --> 00:15:02,521
into the most elegant
office in the capital?

308
00:15:02,545 --> 00:15:03,685
All right.

309
00:15:25,545 --> 00:15:27,125
This is outrageous.

310
00:15:27,465 --> 00:15:29,081
The Bureau answers
directly to His Majesty.

311
00:15:29,105 --> 00:15:30,761
Yet on our first day,

312
00:15:30,785 --> 00:15:32,925
they have not even repaired the building.

313
00:15:33,985 --> 00:15:36,325
The Bureau stands outside the two
Chancellors and Six Ministries.

314
00:15:36,665 --> 00:15:39,165
The Left Chancellor already resents me,

315
00:15:39,745 --> 00:15:42,041
and Minister of Revenue
Wen Tao is his trusted man.

316
00:15:42,065 --> 00:15:43,525
Naturally, he refused the funds

317
00:15:45,265 --> 00:15:47,325
to put me in my place.

318
00:15:49,865 --> 00:15:51,845
It is only a matter of
repairing a building.

319
00:15:52,025 --> 00:15:53,725
No one knows that better than I do.

320
00:15:55,185 --> 00:15:56,885
Find somewhere cool and rest.

321
00:15:57,865 --> 00:15:59,005
Leave this to me.

322
00:16:03,505 --> 00:16:04,801
Official Meng.

323
00:16:04,825 --> 00:16:06,281
It is your first day in office.

324
00:16:06,305 --> 00:16:07,721
How can you do the work yourself?

325
00:16:07,745 --> 00:16:10,321
Why not let me bring a
few servants from home?

326
00:16:10,345 --> 00:16:12,405
It is fine. There is no need.

327
00:16:20,785 --> 00:16:22,085
Who is up there?

328
00:16:24,225 --> 00:16:25,365
Official Meng.

329
00:16:26,105 --> 00:16:27,365
We have met before.

330
00:16:27,745 --> 00:16:28,761
You are that...

331
00:16:28,785 --> 00:16:29,965
I am Yin Qing,

332
00:16:30,185 --> 00:16:31,081
a palace apothecary.

333
00:16:31,105 --> 00:16:32,801
What are you doing at my Bureau?

334
00:16:32,825 --> 00:16:35,045
No one here is buying
rouge or face powder.

335
00:16:35,705 --> 00:16:37,005
Wait for me.

336
00:16:40,425 --> 00:16:41,881
I was only trying to survive in the palace

337
00:16:41,905 --> 00:16:43,241
and had no other choice.

338
00:16:43,265 --> 00:16:46,041
Ever since you handed me
over to Captain Di that day,

339
00:16:46,065 --> 00:16:47,445
I have seen the error of my ways.

340
00:16:49,825 --> 00:16:51,205
I have abandoned that trade.

341
00:16:52,665 --> 00:16:54,081
If you ever need incense,

342
00:16:54,105 --> 00:16:55,685
I will provide it free of charge.

343
00:17:02,865 --> 00:17:04,961
What is all this for?

344
00:17:04,985 --> 00:17:06,081
To ward off evil.

345
00:17:06,105 --> 00:17:08,845
Peach wood drives away evil spirits,

346
00:17:09,145 --> 00:17:12,205
and bronze mirrors reflect foul energy.

347
00:17:12,625 --> 00:17:13,885
This place is haunted.

348
00:17:14,265 --> 00:17:15,361
Without some protection,

349
00:17:15,385 --> 00:17:16,321
I could not sleep at night.

350
00:17:16,345 --> 00:17:17,885
-A haunted place?
-A haunted place?

351
00:17:23,465 --> 00:17:26,405
Official Meng and Assistant
Shen may not know,

352
00:17:27,785 --> 00:17:28,925
but this place

353
00:17:29,505 --> 00:17:32,645
was once an auxiliary interrogation
hall of the Ministry of Justice prison.

354
00:17:35,865 --> 00:17:37,005
It is said

355
00:17:37,745 --> 00:17:40,845
that everyone questioned here

356
00:17:41,145 --> 00:17:43,085
took their own life out of guilt.

357
00:17:44,545 --> 00:17:46,325
It was later abandoned

358
00:17:46,585 --> 00:17:48,121
because it was considered too sinister.

359
00:17:48,145 --> 00:17:50,121
This is an outrageous insult.

360
00:17:50,145 --> 00:17:52,001
How could they assign such
a place to the Bureau?

361
00:17:52,025 --> 00:17:53,361
Official Meng.

362
00:17:53,385 --> 00:17:55,201
At yesterday's banquet, our teacher said

363
00:17:55,225 --> 00:17:56,641
that if anyone caused us trouble,

364
00:17:56,665 --> 00:17:57,761
he would not stand idly by.

365
00:17:57,785 --> 00:17:59,405
Let us go see him now.

366
00:18:00,105 --> 00:18:01,645
Wait.

367
00:18:13,825 --> 00:18:15,365
Assistant Shen, there is no need to fear.

368
00:18:15,785 --> 00:18:16,965
I came prepared.

369
00:18:17,425 --> 00:18:19,041
Once I finish this ritual,

370
00:18:19,065 --> 00:18:21,321
every restless or vengeful spirit

371
00:18:21,345 --> 00:18:23,125
will be driven away.

372
00:18:24,625 --> 00:18:25,845
She faints at blood.

373
00:18:37,905 --> 00:18:38,921
Official Meng.

374
00:18:38,945 --> 00:18:41,561
-Zhili!
-This is my Concentration Dew.

375
00:18:41,585 --> 00:18:43,321
It restores the senses
and clears the mind.

376
00:18:43,345 --> 00:18:44,485
Wait.

377
00:18:46,105 --> 00:18:47,565
Does that medicine really work?

378
00:18:48,305 --> 00:18:49,445
Official Meng,

379
00:18:49,745 --> 00:18:51,561
you may doubt my character,

380
00:18:51,585 --> 00:18:53,605
but you must never doubt my craft.

381
00:19:07,465 --> 00:19:08,605
She is waking up.

382
00:19:15,305 --> 00:19:16,445
Your mouth...

383
00:19:20,305 --> 00:19:21,445
Zhili.

384
00:19:21,985 --> 00:19:23,125
-Zhili!
-Use it again.

385
00:19:35,225 --> 00:19:36,845
What is that smell?

386
00:19:37,265 --> 00:19:38,801
It reeks!

387
00:19:38,825 --> 00:19:40,925
This is my Mind-Clearing Dew.

388
00:19:42,265 --> 00:19:43,481
Official Meng,

389
00:19:43,505 --> 00:19:46,045
Assistant Shen has suffered one
mishap after another since arriving.

390
00:19:46,465 --> 00:19:49,325
Clearly, this courtyard
is heavy with dark energy.

391
00:19:49,865 --> 00:19:52,081
Why not wear this

392
00:19:52,105 --> 00:19:54,001
cinnabar bracelet to ward off evil?

393
00:19:54,025 --> 00:19:55,761
I do not need it. I have a strong fate.

394
00:19:55,785 --> 00:19:56,965
I want it.

395
00:19:57,545 --> 00:19:59,205
I will pay any price.

396
00:20:00,065 --> 00:20:01,765
Only ten taels.

397
00:20:07,545 --> 00:20:08,685
Of course,

398
00:20:08,985 --> 00:20:11,045
five taels would also be acceptable.

399
00:20:13,545 --> 00:20:15,081
For Official Meng's sake,

400
00:20:15,105 --> 00:20:17,321
I will give it to Assistant Shen.

401
00:20:17,345 --> 00:20:18,965
That is far too generous.

402
00:20:21,625 --> 00:20:23,081
Official Meng,

403
00:20:23,105 --> 00:20:24,161
do you think

404
00:20:24,185 --> 00:20:26,161
I am too delicate

405
00:20:26,185 --> 00:20:28,121
and unable to fulfill my
duties as Assistant Director?

406
00:20:28,145 --> 00:20:29,485
Will I only hold you back?

407
00:20:30,105 --> 00:20:31,601
What foolish thing are you saying?

408
00:20:31,625 --> 00:20:34,041
When you made that military
pledge outside the Xu residence,

409
00:20:34,065 --> 00:20:36,961
I knew you were no
ordinary sheltered lady.

410
00:20:36,985 --> 00:20:38,321
To tell the truth,

411
00:20:38,345 --> 00:20:41,201
I thought the bloodshed
surrounding the Bureau

412
00:20:41,225 --> 00:20:42,721
would make you decline the post.

413
00:20:42,745 --> 00:20:43,641
But today,

414
00:20:43,665 --> 00:20:45,805
you arrived with an entire
courtyard of elegance.

415
00:20:46,385 --> 00:20:47,925
I am both surprised and delighted.

416
00:20:52,585 --> 00:20:53,681
As for you,

417
00:20:53,705 --> 00:20:55,565
no one offers favors without a reason.

418
00:20:55,825 --> 00:20:57,281
You came to my Bureau.

419
00:20:57,305 --> 00:20:58,565
What exactly do you want?

420
00:20:59,065 --> 00:21:00,205
Official Meng,

421
00:21:00,505 --> 00:21:02,841
I heard that His Majesty
established the Bureau

422
00:21:02,865 --> 00:21:05,325
and allowed you to choose
your own assistants.

423
00:21:05,665 --> 00:21:08,161
I wish to serve both you and His Majesty

424
00:21:08,185 --> 00:21:09,325
and do my part.

425
00:21:10,745 --> 00:21:12,641
Did you repair

426
00:21:12,665 --> 00:21:13,805
all the roof tiles?

427
00:21:14,425 --> 00:21:15,361
Yes.

428
00:21:15,385 --> 00:21:16,841
Here in the palace,

429
00:21:16,865 --> 00:21:18,841
I always go wherever I am needed

430
00:21:18,865 --> 00:21:20,281
and often do the work of two people.

431
00:21:20,305 --> 00:21:21,801
If either of you needs anything,

432
00:21:21,825 --> 00:21:23,361
simply give me the order.

433
00:21:23,385 --> 00:21:24,961
My martial arts may be rudimentary,

434
00:21:24,985 --> 00:21:27,281
but I know the Five
Elements and Eight Trigrams,

435
00:21:27,305 --> 00:21:28,881
feng shui and geomancy,

436
00:21:28,905 --> 00:21:30,161
beauty remedies and antidotes,

437
00:21:30,185 --> 00:21:31,241
mechanisms and numerology.

438
00:21:31,265 --> 00:21:33,241
I am proficient in all of them.

439
00:21:33,265 --> 00:21:35,565
Are you truly only a minor palace clerk?

440
00:21:35,905 --> 00:21:37,245
You sound

441
00:21:37,465 --> 00:21:39,525
more like a mysterious
master from a storybook.

442
00:21:40,585 --> 00:21:42,165
You flatter me, Assistant Shen.

443
00:21:47,545 --> 00:21:48,441
Official Meng,

444
00:21:48,465 --> 00:21:50,045
this is my latest creation.

445
00:21:51,385 --> 00:21:52,885
It does not smell, I promise.

446
00:21:53,545 --> 00:21:56,045
An enhanced Pearl Whitening Powder.

447
00:21:56,345 --> 00:21:58,281
You seem to have tanned recently.

448
00:21:58,305 --> 00:22:00,285
None of that interests me.

449
00:22:00,665 --> 00:22:02,325
Let me see.

450
00:22:02,625 --> 00:22:03,681
Why did you come to the Bureau?

451
00:22:03,705 --> 00:22:05,325
What is your true purpose?

452
00:22:08,305 --> 00:22:09,601
Official Meng,

453
00:22:09,625 --> 00:22:11,485
after the false Top Scholar case

454
00:22:11,865 --> 00:22:13,801
and the restoration of
the women's special exam,

455
00:22:13,825 --> 00:22:16,201
I came to admire you greatly.

456
00:22:16,225 --> 00:22:19,481
You have courage and talent,

457
00:22:19,505 --> 00:22:21,445
ability, and...

458
00:22:22,905 --> 00:22:25,241
In any case, you are unlike
those stubborn old men.

459
00:22:25,265 --> 00:22:28,045
You and I both came from poor families.

460
00:22:28,385 --> 00:22:29,881
If I can follow you,

461
00:22:29,905 --> 00:22:31,205
I will surely have a future.

462
00:22:32,585 --> 00:22:33,841
Of course,

463
00:22:33,865 --> 00:22:35,881
I came here to pledge my loyalty.

464
00:22:35,905 --> 00:22:36,921
Without a few useful skills,

465
00:22:36,945 --> 00:22:38,325
how could I dare present myself?

466
00:22:49,985 --> 00:22:51,121
Official Meng,

467
00:22:51,145 --> 00:22:53,601
this is my new poison,
Myriad Purples and Reds.

468
00:22:53,625 --> 00:22:54,761
It is colorless and odorless.

469
00:22:54,785 --> 00:22:56,001
One sip

470
00:22:56,025 --> 00:22:57,481
will leave a person unable to fight.

471
00:22:57,505 --> 00:22:59,005
Are you trying to poison me?

472
00:23:11,945 --> 00:23:13,085
I was dying of thirst.

473
00:23:18,865 --> 00:23:20,005
Guard Huang.

474
00:23:20,345 --> 00:23:22,121
-Are you all right?
-Are you all right?

475
00:23:22,145 --> 00:23:23,285
Are you all right?

476
00:23:24,545 --> 00:23:25,685
No, I am not.

477
00:23:27,145 --> 00:23:28,521
It is Official Meng's first day in office.

478
00:23:28,545 --> 00:23:30,201
His Majesty sent me to check on you.

479
00:23:30,225 --> 00:23:32,201
If you encounter trouble
during an investigation,

480
00:23:32,225 --> 00:23:34,961
you may use the command staff to
summon the Divine Guard at any time.

481
00:23:34,985 --> 00:23:36,405
Or report directly to His Majesty.

482
00:23:38,665 --> 00:23:40,245
Guard Huang.

483
00:23:40,505 --> 00:23:42,121
Your voice...

484
00:23:42,145 --> 00:23:43,445
What about my voice?

485
00:23:45,465 --> 00:23:46,885
Is that my voice?

486
00:23:47,905 --> 00:23:49,125
What happened to my voice?

487
00:23:50,145 --> 00:23:52,405
Yin Qing, where is the antidote?

488
00:23:53,625 --> 00:23:55,721
Guard Huang, take this.

489
00:23:55,745 --> 00:23:57,001
In half an incense stick's time,

490
00:23:57,025 --> 00:23:58,041
you should recover

491
00:23:58,065 --> 00:23:59,805
your strong, manly voice.

492
00:24:03,505 --> 00:24:05,241
How am I supposed to report
to His Majesty like this?

493
00:24:05,265 --> 00:24:06,725
This voice...

494
00:24:07,785 --> 00:24:09,761
Will I sound like this
for the rest of my life?

495
00:24:09,785 --> 00:24:11,881
Will I recover completely or not?

496
00:24:11,905 --> 00:24:13,041
This medicine

497
00:24:13,065 --> 00:24:14,885
is something I only recently developed.

498
00:24:15,185 --> 00:24:17,241
It may have certain side effects.

499
00:24:17,265 --> 00:24:18,481
Guard Huang,

500
00:24:18,505 --> 00:24:20,041
go home and sleep today.

501
00:24:20,065 --> 00:24:22,445
You should be fine when you wake tomorrow.

502
00:24:22,785 --> 00:24:24,161
You dared poison me!

503
00:24:24,185 --> 00:24:26,001
No, Official Meng...

504
00:24:26,025 --> 00:24:27,961
I made that medicine
to prove my usefulness.

505
00:24:27,985 --> 00:24:28,881
I meant to drink it.

506
00:24:28,905 --> 00:24:30,601
Guard Huang arrived and
drank it before I could...

507
00:24:30,625 --> 00:24:32,001
Is something wrong with your head?

508
00:24:32,025 --> 00:24:33,521
What sane person poisons himself?

509
00:24:33,545 --> 00:24:35,441
I now suspect you of trying
to poison an imperial guard.

510
00:24:35,465 --> 00:24:36,361
You are coming with me.

511
00:24:36,385 --> 00:24:38,041
No, Official Meng...

512
00:24:38,065 --> 00:24:39,121
Guard Huang.

513
00:24:39,145 --> 00:24:41,201
Yin Qing is the Bureau's first colleague.

514
00:24:41,225 --> 00:24:43,081
This was all a misunderstanding.

515
00:24:43,105 --> 00:24:44,601
Please do not make
things difficult for him.

516
00:24:44,625 --> 00:24:45,721
Guard Huang,

517
00:24:45,745 --> 00:24:46,681
I can testify

518
00:24:46,705 --> 00:24:48,565
that he truly intended
to drink it himself.

519
00:24:50,425 --> 00:24:52,561
Do not let me catch you
causing trouble again.

520
00:24:52,585 --> 00:24:53,805
I will take my leave.

521
00:24:54,225 --> 00:24:55,365
Thank you for coming.

522
00:24:57,585 --> 00:24:58,965
Take care.

523
00:25:00,625 --> 00:25:02,925
Official Meng, you agreed
to let me join the Bureau!

524
00:25:03,385 --> 00:25:04,361
You just saved my life.

525
00:25:04,385 --> 00:25:06,601
You are my lucky star,

526
00:25:06,625 --> 00:25:07,681
my great benefactor.

527
00:25:07,705 --> 00:25:09,681
-From now on, I will obey your every word.
-Official Meng.

528
00:25:09,705 --> 00:25:11,445
Are we truly keeping him?

529
00:25:12,785 --> 00:25:14,841
Our Bureau may be small,

530
00:25:14,865 --> 00:25:16,685
but we will never keep anyone useless.

531
00:25:18,665 --> 00:25:19,805
You

532
00:25:20,185 --> 00:25:21,445
may stay for now,

533
00:25:21,785 --> 00:25:23,125
pending evaluation.

534
00:25:24,345 --> 00:25:25,881
It is not small, and I am useful!

535
00:25:25,905 --> 00:25:28,125
Evaluate me all you like.
I will get back to work.

536
00:26:46,945 --> 00:26:48,121
Official Meng.

537
00:26:48,145 --> 00:26:49,445
What are you looking at?

538
00:26:50,905 --> 00:26:52,405
Nothing.

539
00:26:54,225 --> 00:26:56,601
Where did you find all these people?

540
00:26:56,625 --> 00:26:59,081
The wives and daughters of these craftsmen

541
00:26:59,105 --> 00:27:00,081
are regular customers of mine.

542
00:27:00,105 --> 00:27:01,321
I promised them

543
00:27:01,345 --> 00:27:02,721
that if they came to help,

544
00:27:02,745 --> 00:27:05,245
they could buy rouge
from me at half price.

545
00:27:06,825 --> 00:27:08,725
You truly can do anything.

546
00:27:10,105 --> 00:27:11,921
You also have a talent for business.

547
00:27:11,945 --> 00:27:13,521
If Fu Zhi knew you,

548
00:27:13,545 --> 00:27:14,601
you two would surely get along.

549
00:27:14,625 --> 00:27:17,565
I have no plans to marry.

550
00:27:17,945 --> 00:27:19,645
Keep dreaming.

551
00:27:20,865 --> 00:27:21,761
By the way, Official Meng,

552
00:27:21,785 --> 00:27:22,881
enough about me.

553
00:27:22,905 --> 00:27:24,761
The rear courtyard is
ready, and so is the food.

554
00:27:24,785 --> 00:27:25,925
Let us eat first.

555
00:27:29,145 --> 00:27:30,845
Do not put it there. Move it over.

556
00:27:38,665 --> 00:27:40,281
Official Meng, Assistant Shen.

557
00:27:40,305 --> 00:27:42,481
I personally prepared
some of my best dishes.

558
00:27:42,505 --> 00:27:43,645
Please try them.

559
00:27:44,585 --> 00:27:47,365
-Sit and eat with us.
-How could I presume?

560
00:27:49,985 --> 00:27:51,125
Please.

561
00:28:05,265 --> 00:28:06,201
Yin Qing,

562
00:28:06,225 --> 00:28:08,525
your cooking is remarkable.

563
00:28:19,665 --> 00:28:20,805
Assistant Shen,

564
00:28:21,465 --> 00:28:23,205
is the food not to your liking?

565
00:28:23,865 --> 00:28:24,761
No.

566
00:28:24,785 --> 00:28:26,281
I am merely

567
00:28:26,305 --> 00:28:28,845
a little particular about food.

568
00:28:30,585 --> 00:28:32,161
Tell me any requirements you have.

569
00:28:32,185 --> 00:28:34,365
I will make the proper changes.

570
00:28:35,985 --> 00:28:38,641
I do not really have any requirements.

571
00:28:38,665 --> 00:28:40,441
For this stir-fried pork with celtuce,

572
00:28:40,465 --> 00:28:43,041
the celtuce must be cut into
inch-long pieces to absorb the flavor,

573
00:28:43,065 --> 00:28:44,401
and the meat sliced paper-thin.

574
00:28:44,425 --> 00:28:45,921
As for this Snow-Cloud Soup,

575
00:28:45,945 --> 00:28:47,761
the mushrooms must be picked before dawn.

576
00:28:47,785 --> 00:28:50,481
After noon, they take on an earthy smell.

577
00:28:50,505 --> 00:28:51,801
As for these seasonal vegetables,

578
00:28:51,825 --> 00:28:54,081
use only a little salt
and very little oil.

579
00:28:54,105 --> 00:28:56,001
Preferably, do not add
even a drop of soy sauce,

580
00:28:56,025 --> 00:28:57,565
so their natural flavor remains.

581
00:29:06,945 --> 00:29:08,881
I was only speaking casually.

582
00:29:08,905 --> 00:29:10,481
There is no need to take it to heart.

583
00:29:10,505 --> 00:29:12,765
I was not very hungry anyway.

584
00:29:16,385 --> 00:29:17,765
Good.

585
00:29:22,065 --> 00:29:24,445
Now that we have formally taken office,

586
00:29:24,705 --> 00:29:26,121
we must uproot the Tiger Roar Gang

587
00:29:26,145 --> 00:29:28,085
and the forces behind it.

588
00:29:28,465 --> 00:29:29,361
Official Meng,

589
00:29:29,385 --> 00:29:31,401
we could consult the Capital Prefecture

590
00:29:31,425 --> 00:29:32,601
and the Court of Judicial Review

591
00:29:32,625 --> 00:29:33,761
and request the case files.

592
00:29:33,785 --> 00:29:35,321
But the various ministries

593
00:29:35,345 --> 00:29:37,121
already have many
objections to the Bureau.

594
00:29:37,145 --> 00:29:38,845
If we follow the usual procedure,

595
00:29:39,225 --> 00:29:41,281
it may take ten days or even half a month.

596
00:29:41,305 --> 00:29:42,961
If anyone deliberately obstructs us,

597
00:29:42,985 --> 00:29:44,925
we can ask His Majesty to rule on it.

598
00:29:45,265 --> 00:29:47,481
I can also ask our teacher to mediate.

599
00:29:47,505 --> 00:29:48,841
But for such a minor matter,

600
00:29:48,865 --> 00:29:51,085
must we trouble His Majesty
and the Right Chancellor?

601
00:29:51,385 --> 00:29:54,125
Would that not make the Bureau
look like an easy target?

602
00:29:57,785 --> 00:30:00,005
Then what do you plan to do?

603
00:30:01,425 --> 00:30:03,041
Gangs commit crimes

604
00:30:03,065 --> 00:30:05,085
for no reason other than
to gather illicit wealth.

605
00:30:05,825 --> 00:30:07,361
But beneath a prosperous surface,

606
00:30:07,385 --> 00:30:09,085
such wealth is often
hidden most carefully.

607
00:30:09,585 --> 00:30:11,201
Changle Street

608
00:30:11,225 --> 00:30:12,761
may hold some clues.

609
00:30:12,785 --> 00:30:14,881
Once Bofeng House opens,

610
00:30:14,905 --> 00:30:16,961
it can serve as a place for
us to gather intelligence.

611
00:30:16,985 --> 00:30:18,165
Yin Qing.

612
00:30:18,665 --> 00:30:20,121
Present.

613
00:30:20,145 --> 00:30:21,485
Bring me a bronze gong.

614
00:30:21,825 --> 00:30:23,001
I am going to do something important.

615
00:30:23,025 --> 00:30:24,245
Right away.

616
00:30:30,945 --> 00:30:32,405
Bureau investigation!

617
00:30:32,785 --> 00:30:34,685
His Majesty personally
established the Bureau

618
00:30:34,945 --> 00:30:36,645
to suppress gangs and root out evil.

619
00:30:37,345 --> 00:30:39,801
Anyone with information
about the Tiger Roar Gang

620
00:30:39,825 --> 00:30:41,525
may report it to the Bureau.

621
00:30:43,785 --> 00:30:45,441
What sort of fearsome group
is the Tiger Roar Gang?

622
00:30:45,465 --> 00:30:46,561
What did they do

623
00:30:46,585 --> 00:30:47,961
to make the court

624
00:30:47,985 --> 00:30:49,765
launch such a grand investigation?

625
00:30:49,945 --> 00:30:51,681
The court sent a female
official to investigate.

626
00:30:51,705 --> 00:30:53,081
It cannot be a serious case.

627
00:30:53,105 --> 00:30:54,081
Let us go.

628
00:30:54,105 --> 00:30:56,325
-Everyone, disperse.
-You...

629
00:30:56,785 --> 00:30:58,441
There is nothing to see. Let us leave.

630
00:30:58,465 --> 00:31:00,005
Come on...

631
00:31:03,785 --> 00:31:04,925
Official Meng.

632
00:31:05,265 --> 00:31:06,605
This method

633
00:31:06,785 --> 00:31:08,565
does not seem very useful.

634
00:31:12,185 --> 00:31:14,445
It appears the Tiger Roar
Gang is deeply hidden,

635
00:31:15,465 --> 00:31:19,085
unlike Black Tiger Hall, which
flaunted itself before everyone.

636
00:31:19,385 --> 00:31:20,801
But as far as I know,

637
00:31:20,825 --> 00:31:22,721
many people report daily
to the capital courts

638
00:31:22,745 --> 00:31:24,121
to complain about local thugs

639
00:31:24,145 --> 00:31:26,365
and report injustices.

640
00:31:29,705 --> 00:31:31,001
The Bureau of Intelligence

641
00:31:31,025 --> 00:31:32,845
exists to protect the people.

642
00:31:33,145 --> 00:31:34,641
Anyone harmed by criminals

643
00:31:34,665 --> 00:31:36,361
or bullies who prey on the weak

644
00:31:36,385 --> 00:31:37,841
may come and file a complaint.

645
00:31:37,865 --> 00:31:40,965
I will see justice done for you.

646
00:31:54,545 --> 00:31:55,801
Official Meng.

647
00:31:55,825 --> 00:31:57,725
Let me carry that.

648
00:32:08,225 --> 00:32:11,241
I never imagined the capital
had such a run-down district.

649
00:32:11,265 --> 00:32:13,641
The north of the city is
home mostly to the poor,

650
00:32:13,665 --> 00:32:16,125
refugees, and beggars.

651
00:32:16,505 --> 00:32:17,641
Assistant Shen was born

652
00:32:17,665 --> 00:32:19,281
a noble lady from the eastern district.

653
00:32:19,305 --> 00:32:20,645
Naturally, you have never been here.

654
00:32:23,305 --> 00:32:24,805
Official Meng,

655
00:32:34,225 --> 00:32:35,761
we have sold

656
00:32:35,785 --> 00:32:37,405
everything of value in the house.

657
00:32:37,665 --> 00:32:39,685
I also gathered twenty
taels from my family,

658
00:32:41,105 --> 00:32:43,085
but we are still more
than ten taels short.

659
00:32:43,585 --> 00:32:45,485
You have worked hard.

660
00:32:48,985 --> 00:32:51,481
Those corpse thieves beat you so badly

661
00:32:51,505 --> 00:32:52,965
that you have not yet recovered.

662
00:32:53,505 --> 00:32:55,285
You must not leave your bed.

663
00:33:00,425 --> 00:33:02,081
Grandmother,

664
00:33:02,105 --> 00:33:04,001
I have failed you.

665
00:33:04,025 --> 00:33:06,285
They stole Grandfather's remains

666
00:33:06,865 --> 00:33:08,481
and demanded a huge ransom.

667
00:33:08,505 --> 00:33:10,201
But we simply cannot raise enough money

668
00:33:10,225 --> 00:33:12,201
to redeem his body.

669
00:33:12,225 --> 00:33:14,601
Now, even after your first
seven days have passed,

670
00:33:14,625 --> 00:33:16,921
I still dare not bury you.

671
00:33:16,945 --> 00:33:19,725
I fear those heartless corpse thieves

672
00:33:20,385 --> 00:33:22,525
will steal your body too

673
00:33:22,785 --> 00:33:24,601
and extort us again.

674
00:33:24,625 --> 00:33:25,805
Grandmother,

675
00:33:27,225 --> 00:33:29,725
there is truly no way for us to survive.

676
00:33:34,545 --> 00:33:35,685
Who is outside?

677
00:33:37,945 --> 00:33:39,085
Bureau investigation.

678
00:33:40,305 --> 00:33:41,561
You...

679
00:33:41,585 --> 00:33:43,165
You are the woman from the street.

680
00:33:43,905 --> 00:33:45,401
Leave at once. Go!

681
00:33:45,425 --> 00:33:47,001
We mean you no harm.

682
00:33:47,025 --> 00:33:49,321
We saw you frowning in
distress on the street

683
00:33:49,345 --> 00:33:50,881
and worried that you were in trouble,

684
00:33:50,905 --> 00:33:52,285
so we came to learn what happened.

685
00:33:52,545 --> 00:33:54,001
The Bureau answers directly to His Majesty

686
00:33:54,025 --> 00:33:55,441
and acts on behalf of the Son of Heaven.

687
00:33:55,465 --> 00:33:56,761
Telling Official Meng

688
00:33:56,785 --> 00:33:58,365
is the same as telling His Majesty.

689
00:33:59,545 --> 00:34:01,525
Official Meng...

690
00:34:02,385 --> 00:34:03,765
A-Cheng.

691
00:34:05,145 --> 00:34:07,325
A-Cheng, you cannot tell them.

692
00:34:07,745 --> 00:34:10,485
If you do, we will never
recover Grandfather's body.

693
00:34:22,905 --> 00:34:25,561
We reported the case to the authorities,

694
00:34:25,585 --> 00:34:28,405
but they considered it too minor

695
00:34:28,705 --> 00:34:30,081
and ignored us.

696
00:34:30,105 --> 00:34:32,841
Because of that, the corpse thieves

697
00:34:32,865 --> 00:34:35,485
threatened us and took revenge.

698
00:34:35,785 --> 00:34:36,925
Official Meng,

699
00:34:37,625 --> 00:34:39,841
we truly have no way to survive.

700
00:34:39,865 --> 00:34:41,565
Corpse thieves?

701
00:34:49,585 --> 00:34:51,045
Well?

702
00:34:51,625 --> 00:34:53,885
What do you think of my attire today?

703
00:34:55,945 --> 00:34:58,081
I am known as Changle
Street's finest gentleman,

704
00:34:58,105 --> 00:35:00,201
but after seeing Your
Majesty dressed like this,

705
00:35:00,225 --> 00:35:02,441
I can only surrender the title.

706
00:35:02,465 --> 00:35:04,161
If the noble ladies of the
capital saw Your Majesty,

707
00:35:04,185 --> 00:35:05,721
would they not all be left drooling?

708
00:35:05,745 --> 00:35:08,161
Enough flattery.

709
00:35:08,185 --> 00:35:09,485
How do we leave the palace today?

710
00:35:10,705 --> 00:35:11,841
I examined some old records

711
00:35:11,865 --> 00:35:13,321
and discovered an abandoned passage

712
00:35:13,345 --> 00:35:15,045
that leads directly outside the palace.

713
00:35:15,625 --> 00:35:17,005
Lead the way.

714
00:35:31,425 --> 00:35:32,321
Cousin.

715
00:35:32,345 --> 00:35:33,801
While serving as Folkways Commissioner,

716
00:35:33,825 --> 00:35:35,521
I spared no effort,
neglected sleep and food,

717
00:35:35,545 --> 00:35:36,441
and traveled day and night

718
00:35:36,465 --> 00:35:38,005
until I finally found this place.

719
00:35:47,745 --> 00:35:49,525
Huiyin House has fascinating rules.

720
00:35:50,065 --> 00:35:52,361
Guests must submit a calling
card half a month in advance.

721
00:35:52,385 --> 00:35:53,601
Each honored guest chooses a theme,

722
00:35:53,625 --> 00:35:55,125
and the musicians improvise.

723
00:35:55,625 --> 00:35:56,521
When the piece ends,

724
00:35:56,545 --> 00:35:59,241
they also serve a special
tea inspired by its meaning.

725
00:35:59,265 --> 00:36:01,281
The proprietor, Situ Xue, has become
famous over the past two years

726
00:36:01,305 --> 00:36:03,241
and is known as the
capital's finest dancer.

727
00:36:03,265 --> 00:36:04,601
Countless people spend fortunes

728
00:36:04,625 --> 00:36:06,045
just to glimpse her beauty.

729
00:36:07,745 --> 00:36:08,641
Cousin.

730
00:36:08,665 --> 00:36:09,921
At the Flower Festival a few days ago,

731
00:36:09,945 --> 00:36:12,125
did you not praise the
begonia-like beauty in her eyes?

732
00:36:12,865 --> 00:36:14,845
Enough. Where is the clue?

733
00:36:15,505 --> 00:36:17,601
Cousin, it was difficult
enough to get out today.

734
00:36:17,625 --> 00:36:18,841
Why the hurry?

735
00:36:18,865 --> 00:36:20,005
Here,

736
00:36:20,585 --> 00:36:22,325
you must first learn to enjoy yourself.

737
00:36:22,545 --> 00:36:23,685
Please.

738
00:36:36,465 --> 00:36:38,601
It truly is the Xiyan flower.

739
00:36:38,625 --> 00:36:39,765
Young Master Shen.

740
00:36:55,745 --> 00:36:57,321
It has only been a few days,

741
00:36:57,345 --> 00:36:58,925
you look even more radiant.

742
00:37:00,225 --> 00:37:02,721
Young Master Shen, you have not
visited Huiyin House for some time.

743
00:37:02,745 --> 00:37:04,521
Many noble young ladies

744
00:37:04,545 --> 00:37:06,281
came hoping to encounter you,

745
00:37:06,305 --> 00:37:07,445
only to leave disappointed.

746
00:37:09,305 --> 00:37:10,921
And this gentleman is?

747
00:37:10,945 --> 00:37:12,761
This is my distant cousin, He Du.

748
00:37:12,785 --> 00:37:14,241
He has been troubled lately,

749
00:37:14,265 --> 00:37:15,725
so he came to me for some diversion.

750
00:37:16,105 --> 00:37:17,201
He heard that Miss Situ's

751
00:37:17,225 --> 00:37:18,361
music can dispel all sorrows,

752
00:37:18,385 --> 00:37:20,285
and came especially to
request a soothing piece.

753
00:37:24,985 --> 00:37:26,161
My cousin is rather reserved.

754
00:37:26,185 --> 00:37:27,605
Please forgive him, Proprietor.

755
00:37:28,025 --> 00:37:30,365
Since he is Young Master Shen's friend,

756
00:37:30,825 --> 00:37:32,605
I naturally dare not neglect him.

757
00:37:32,865 --> 00:37:35,121
Each quiet room here is
reserved for one guest,

758
00:37:35,145 --> 00:37:36,485
ideal for clearing the mind.

759
00:37:37,865 --> 00:37:40,085
Cousin, I will leave you two to talk.

760
00:37:43,425 --> 00:37:44,645
Thank you, Proprietor.

761
00:38:53,905 --> 00:38:56,565
I have long heard that Huiyin
House hides wonders within,

762
00:38:56,785 --> 00:38:58,241
and your qin playing is peerless.

763
00:38:58,265 --> 00:38:59,765
Having seen it today,

764
00:39:00,065 --> 00:39:01,565
I find your reputation well deserved.

765
00:39:03,105 --> 00:39:04,765
You flatter me, sir.

766
00:39:10,185 --> 00:39:12,885
I noticed you repeatedly
looking at the screen.

767
00:39:13,345 --> 00:39:15,165
Does it interest you?

768
00:39:16,345 --> 00:39:17,485
This quiet room

769
00:39:17,905 --> 00:39:19,761
is filled with elegant shades of green.

770
00:39:19,785 --> 00:39:21,561
Only the purple flowers on this screen

771
00:39:21,585 --> 00:39:23,401
are strikingly vivid.

772
00:39:23,425 --> 00:39:25,961
You break the serenity with splendor.

773
00:39:25,985 --> 00:39:27,685
It is a most ingenious touch.

774
00:39:27,905 --> 00:39:29,365
Does it hold some deeper meaning?

775
00:39:30,545 --> 00:39:31,925
It does.

776
00:39:32,185 --> 00:39:34,281
Some time ago, in Beijian,

777
00:39:34,305 --> 00:39:35,641
a folk music troupe

778
00:39:35,665 --> 00:39:38,245
passed through the
capital and stayed here.

779
00:39:38,505 --> 00:39:41,521
I found the floral ornaments on the
musicians' foreheads very distinctive,

780
00:39:41,545 --> 00:39:42,881
so I asked them about them.

781
00:39:42,905 --> 00:39:44,921
This flower is called Xiyan.

782
00:39:44,945 --> 00:39:45,961
It blooms at night and fades by dawn.

783
00:39:45,985 --> 00:39:48,561
In Beijian, it symbolizes fleeting beauty

784
00:39:48,585 --> 00:39:50,205
and is extremely popular.

785
00:39:50,745 --> 00:39:52,641
This quiet room is elegant,

786
00:39:52,665 --> 00:39:54,205
but slightly somber.

787
00:39:54,465 --> 00:39:56,401
I also happen to like the Xiyan flower,

788
00:39:56,425 --> 00:39:58,401
so I commissioned this screen.

789
00:39:58,425 --> 00:40:00,485
If you like it,

790
00:40:01,025 --> 00:40:02,401
may I give it to you?

791
00:40:02,425 --> 00:40:04,325
I appreciate your kindness, Proprietor.

792
00:40:05,345 --> 00:40:07,445
However, I once read in
some miscellaneous books

793
00:40:07,745 --> 00:40:10,645
that this flower
represents a vow to devour

794
00:40:11,345 --> 00:40:14,365
and carries meanings of
vengeance and hatred.

795
00:40:15,985 --> 00:40:17,365
Mind your words, sir.

796
00:40:17,745 --> 00:40:19,961
Huiyin House welcomes all guests

797
00:40:19,985 --> 00:40:21,521
and values goodwill

798
00:40:21,545 --> 00:40:23,081
and harmony above all.

799
00:40:23,105 --> 00:40:25,801
I bear no grudge against
the people of Beijian.

800
00:40:25,825 --> 00:40:28,445
I doubt they would deceive me.

801
00:40:34,825 --> 00:40:36,845
There is no need to be
alarmed, Proprietor.

802
00:40:37,065 --> 00:40:38,441
The meaning of a flower

803
00:40:38,465 --> 00:40:40,165
is merely what the human
heart wishes to see.

804
00:40:40,985 --> 00:40:42,885
Everyone interprets it differently.

805
00:40:43,665 --> 00:40:44,805
Sir.

806
00:40:45,065 --> 00:40:46,205
Please have some tea.

807
00:41:05,705 --> 00:41:07,125
Excellent tea.

